-- Kept on ASSUME deliberately (IMPLICIT-PROPS-DESIGN.md §11.1, R0: ASSUME is deprecated): an #ASSERT over a bare assumed BOOLEAN is the thing under test.
-- Typechecks cleanly; neither #ASSERT can be decided. A bare assumed BOOLEAN
-- is neither TRUE nor FALSE: `#ASSERT NOT b` forces b and RAISES (stuck on an
-- assumed term), while `#ASSERT b` reduces to the symbolic b WITHOUT raising.
-- Both must report the same undecided outcome.
ASSUME b IS A BOOLEAN
#ASSERT b
#ASSERT NOT b
